ty."},{"type":"h","text":"Essential"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Microsoft PowerPoint"},{"text":"Microsoft Word"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Learning Management Systems"},{"text":"Online classroom platforms"},{"text":"Digital assessment tools"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learning Management Systems"},{"text":"Simulation platforms"},{"text":"Virtual simulation"},{"text":"Interactive quizzes"},{"text":"Digital content creation"},{"text":"Educational video production"},{"text":"Basic data analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful supporting skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"SPSS"},{"text":"Research data analysis"},{"text":"Survey analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Python and SQL are optional, but can become valuable for educational analytics and healthcare research."}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For this career, clinical experience is extremely valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Internship/Experience Areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Multi-specialty hospitals"},{"text":"Teaching hospitals"},{"text":"Nursing colleges"},{"text":"Simulation centres"},{"text":"Community health programmes"},{"text":"Nursing skill laboratories"},{"text":"Healthcare training organizations"},{"text":"Clinical education departments"},{"text":"Hospital staff-training departments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Experience Sequence"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Nursing","Clinical Internship","Staff Nurse / Clinical Nurse","Clinical Specialty Experience","M.Sc Nursing / Relevant PG","Clinical Teaching Exposure","Clinical Instructor","Nurse Educator","Senior Nurse Educator / Faculty"]}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A fresh B.Sc Nursing graduate should not assume that Nurse Educator will always b